cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, or parts of its code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SoftRing"
abstract: >-
  A tiny Android app that lowers the ringtone and notification volume whenever you
  want (during the hours you choose, every day, or until it is turned off) and then
  restores the previous volumes. It
  complements Android modes such as "Do Not Disturb": they decide who can ring, SoftRing
  decides how loud. No internet permission, no third-party libraries.
